T00:00:00+08:00", "i": 0.06, "coords": [[0.0, 2217.8], [-1227.7, 2162.3], [-1511.1, 2994.0], [-944.4, 3881.1], [-94.4, 3881.1]], "ev": "\u6838\u5b9e"}], "breaches": [{"id": "guanghua-se", "gate": "guanghua", "offset": -34, "width": 16, "drop": 9, "at": "1937-12-10T17:00:00+08:00", "plugged": [["1937-12-10T22:00:00+08:00", "1937-12-12T14:00:00+08:00"]], "src": "Dec 10 17:00 sappers blew the ruined wall at the south-east corner; the defenders plugged it with sandbags; broken again Dec 12 (zh.wikipedia \u5149\u534e\u95e8); place, size and plug times \u63a8\u6d4b", "s": 28936.1}, {"id": "zhonghua-w", "gate": "zhonghua", "offset": 140, "width": 22, "drop": 10, "at": "1937-12-12T17:00:00+08:00", "plugged": [], "src": "Dec 12 artillery brought down part of the wall and the Japanese took the gate through the gap, swarming in at 17:00 (en.wikipedia Battle of Nanking; the timeline's ev-1212-zhonghua-shelling peaks at 17:00); the 47th regiment held a stretch of wall west of the gate at 12:20 (ja.wikipedia \u5357\u4eac\u6226); place and size \u63a8\u6d4b", "s": 100.7}, {"id": "zhongshan-s", "gate": "zhongshan", "offset": 230, "width": 40, "drop": 11, "at": "1937-12-12T15:00:00+08:00", "plugged": [], "src": "Dec 12 a large portion of the wall gave way under the 16th Division's guns (en.wikipedia Battle of Nanking); the 9th Division faced the wall south-east of the gate (ja.wikipedia \u5357\u4eac\u6226); place and size \u63a8\u6d4b", "s": 26548.8}]}